      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2975195660,
          "type": null,
          "body": "In this case, people having display filters relying on this letter will need to update them, but I don't believe it's widely used currently.\n\nAbout the ACK flag, in our case a letter is still better as it's pretty difficult to write a display filter based on dot, decimal point, or anything similar. Letters are more readable, but tcpdump just shows the flags which are set, not all of them. At the end, tcpdump using a dot is very comfortable for the user.",
